{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ1週間、直属の上司が\nお休みでおらず、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しバタバタな日々を過ごしてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月初なので\n1人で出納完了を任されたんですが、\nこういう時に限って\nイレギュラーなことばかりで...\n完璧に終わらせられませんでした（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと3ヶ月で後輩も入ってくるのに\nまだまだ一人立ちは出来なさそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/06/3243826/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ろう（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/06/3243826/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが\n先週末は個別握手会でした〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん\n23歳の私とはじめましてでしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/06/3243826/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しかったです( ^ω^ )\n来て下さった皆さんありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服はこんな感じ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/06/3243826/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェックスカート\nビジュートップス\n黒ストッキング"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/06/3243826/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニット\nチェックパンツ\nおじ眼鏡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/06/3243826/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白ニット\n1部でも着たスカート\nパールネックレス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近服を褒めてくれる人\n多くて嬉しいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなの着てみて欲しい！ってのが\n有ったらリクエストしてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着れる範囲で挑戦しますψ(｀∇´)ψ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は明日のアルバム個握と\n明後日の10thラスト個握！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何着ようかな〜ψ(｀∇´)ψ？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/06/3243826/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週はバレンタイン回です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/06/3243826/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はりきってお菓子作りを\nしています〜ψ(｀∇´)ψ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/06/3243826/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"料理部久しぶりで嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/06/3243826/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと！\n前に告知出来なかったけど、\n文芸部〜後半戦〜も\n是非見て欲しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/06/3243826/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"助監督頑張りました〜( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい作品になってると思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/06/3243826/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/06/3243826/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬に飲みたいスープといえば？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豚汁。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばあちゃんが作る豚汁は世界一！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/06/3243826/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなパンは何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メゾンカイザーの\nクロワッサンダマンドが好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは最近\nフランスパンも美味しくて\n困ってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のアルバム個別は\n何着ようか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/06/3243826/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また更新します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"p.s.畠中さんの卒業に関しては\nまた今度。"}],"source":"archive"}